{
 "about": "Stage B test option 2: a tilt EQ on top of SSO CC1 so the strings brighten pp->ff like real players. Per band: real players ff-pp (TU Berlin anechoic, Weinzierl et al. 2024, doi 10.14279/depositonce-19858, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; derived numbers only) minus SSO All techniques Long CC1 127-16 (Windows VM, kthost + Kontakt 8, library defaults), each band relative to the note total; a band only where pp and ff are >= cleanDb above the chamber noise; the curve holds the nearest measured band outside them. Rule D: EQ(k) = curve * factor * (k-3)/7, k = 0..7 ppp..fff. tools/soundlibraries/tilt_eq.py fit. Test only, not read by MuseScore.",
